  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>Sent to be the first team to sit through a complete tidal year on the archipelago coast, and the fourth to fail to. Five years produced the drain-and-fill sequence for two of the three channels, a structured record of who goes where when the flats empty, and a great deal of equipment recovered from mud. The year defeated them for the usual reason: the ship&#39;s window closed eleven weeks before the cycle did. A fifth attempt has been proposed in each of the last four rounds and is not yet funded.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
